'''Meowth's Ballad''' (Japanese: '''ニャースのバラード''' ''Nyarth no Barādo'') is one of {{MTR}}'s character songs. It was released as part of the XY&Z TV Anime Character Song Project. It was also used as the ninth Japanese ending theme of ''[[Pokémon the Series: XY]]'', being used in [[XY135]], [[XY136]], and [[XY139]]. Additionally, it was used as an insert song in [[SM021]] and [[JN095]].

==Ending animation==
===Synopsis===
{{MTR}} sings and strums a guitar in an open field with a full moon in the sky while [[Jessie]], [[James]], and their Pokémon watch.

===Characters===
* [[Jessie]]
* [[James]]

====Pokémon====
* {{p|Meowth}} ({{TRM}})
* {{p|Wobbuffet}} ({{OP|Jessie|Wobbuffet}})
* {{p|Gourgeist}} ({{OP|Jessie|Gourgeist}})
* {{p|Inkay}} ({{OP|James|Inkay}})

